  "Take it from my own picture too": "Ichukue pia kutoka kwenye picha yangu mwenyewe",
  "Take the colour from what's on screen": "Chukua rangi kutoka kwa kilicho skrini",
  "Text": "Maandishi",
  "That backup is empty.": "Nakala rudufu hiyo ni tupu.",
  "That backup is in format {version}, which this build doesn't know how to read.": "Nakala rudufu hiyo iko katika muundo {version}, ambao toleo hili halijui jinsi ya kuusoma.",
  "That doesn't look like a URL. Paste an addon link, or one starting with https://": "Hiyo haionekani kama URL. Bandika kiungo cha kiongezi, au kimoja kinachoanza na https://",
  "That file isn't JSON, so it isn't a backup.": "Faili hiyo si JSON, hivyo si nakala rudufu.",
  "That isn't a Ventic backup.": "Hiyo si nakala rudufu ya Ventic.",
  "That picture couldn't be saved. Try a smaller one, or a JPEG or PNG.": "Picha hiyo haikuweza kuhifadhiwa. Jaribu ndogo zaidi, au JPEG au PNG.",
  "That source is already in the list.": "Chanzo hicho tayari kipo kwenye orodha.",
  "That torrent holds no video file.": "Torrent hiyo haina faili yoyote ya video.",
  "That's everything.": "Hicho ndicho chote.",
  "The connection to the torrent engine dropped mid-stream.": "Muunganisho kwenye injini ya torrent ulikatika katikati ya mtiririko.",
  "The link this source gave could not be reached.": "Kiungo alichotoa chanzo hiki hakikuweza kufikiwa.",
  "The picture currently behind the app": "Picha iliyo nyuma ya programu kwa sasa",
  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "Eneo la kicheza halikupata ukubwa kamwe, hivyo kuchezwa hakukuanzishwa.",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "Kicheza chenyewe — usimbuaji, manukuu na sauti. GPLv2 au baadaye.",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Mradi huu hauhifadhi, hauendeshi, hauidhinishi wala haupendekezi chanzo chochote, na hausambazi orodha yake.",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "Toleo hili halina sasisho kwa mfumo huu.",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "Chanzo tayari kimekipata hiki — hucheza mara moja na hakiachi kitu kwenye kifaa hiki",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "Injini ya torrent ilikubali magnet lakini haikuipa kitambulisho.",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "Injini ya torrent, iliyojengwa ndani ya programu. Leseni ya MIT.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Sasisho halikuweza kusakinishwa: {error}",
  "Theme": "Mandhari",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Hapa kuna nafasi ya filamu moja tu kwa shida. Chomeka diski ya USB kwenye kisanduku — iliyofomatiwa FAT32, ambayo kila kisanduku cha Android hukubali — nayo itaonekana hapo juu ili kupakua ndani yake badala yake.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Hakuna akaunti ya kuingia wala kitu kinachosawazishwa na seva. Unachotazama, ulipofikia, vipendwa vyako na orodha yako ya kutazama vyote huhifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki na havikitoki kamwe. Kusawazisha kati ya skrini kumepangwa; hadi wakati huo, nakala rudufu iliyo hapa chini ndiyo njia ya kuhamisha maktaba.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Hakuna {file} kwenye folda yako ya nyaraka. Nakili moja hapo na ujaribu tena.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Muunganisho huu unapimwa kwa sasa.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Muunganisho huu haupimwi kwa sasa.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Ventic's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "Nakala hii haikusakinishwa na kisakinishi cha Ventic chenyewe — bali na kidhibiti vifurushi, au ilijengwa kutoka kwa msimbo — hivyo kilichoiweka pale ndicho kinachoisasisha. Kubadilisha faili kutoka hapa kungekichanganya tu.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Kisimbuzi cha kifaa hiki kilishindwa na faili hiyo. Mara nyingi ni sauti: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) na DTS hazina leseni ndani ya webview ya mfumo, hivyo toleo lenye mojawapo hucheza kama picha bila sauti, au halichezi kabisa. Toleo la x264 lenye sauti ya AAC litacheza.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Faili hii ina wimbo mmoja wa sauti.",
  "Timing": "Muda",
  "Tint": "Rangi ya juu",
  "Title": "Kichwa",
  "Too big for the download drive": "Kubwa mno kwa diski ya upakuaji",
  "Top rated": "Zilizokadiriwa juu zaidi",
  "Torrent engine offline.": "Injini ya torrent haipo mtandaoni.",
  "Torrents": "Torrent",
