  "Transfers": "Uhamishaji",
  "Trending": "Zinazovuma",
  "Turns off the effects that cost the most to draw: the frosted blur behind the sidebar and menus, the blur on the background art, and the fades and slides that play as things appear or take focus. Everything stays where it was and nothing is hidden — it stops moving and goes crisp instead. Loading spinners keep turning.": "Huzima athari zinazogharimu zaidi kuchorwa: ukungu wa barafu nyuma ya upau wa pembeni na menyu, ukungu wa sanaa ya mandharinyuma, na kufifia na kuteleza kunakotokea vitu vinapojitokeza au kupata umakini. Kila kitu hubaki kilipokuwa na hakuna kinachofichwa — huacha tu kusogea na kuwa kikavu badala yake. Vizungushi vya upakiaji huendelea kuzunguka.",
  "Type in the search box to find movies and shows.": "Andika kwenye kisanduku cha kutafuta ili kupata filamu na vipindi.",
  "Unmute (m)": "Washa sauti (m)",
  "Unreadable": "Haisomeki",
  "Upcoming": "Zinazokuja",
  "Update now": "Sasisha sasa",
  "Updates": "Masasisho",
  "Updates are checked in the installed app, not here.": "Masasisho hukaguliwa katika programu iliyosakinishwa, si hapa.",
  "Upload": "Upakiaji",
  "Use default": "Tumia chaguomsingi",
  "Ventic asks a source for {movie}, or {series}, and expects a {streams} array back. Add several and their results are merged, with duplicates dropped and earlier sources preferred.": "Ventic huomba chanzo {movie}, au {series}, na hutarajia kupokea safu ya {streams}. Ongeza kadhaa na matokeo yao huunganishwa, nakala zilizojirudia huondolewa na vyanzo vilivyoongezwa mapema hupewa kipaumbele.",
  "Ventic has no sources configured, so there is nowhere to search. You can still play a magnet or a torrent file you open yourself.": "Ventic haina vyanzo vilivyowekwa, hivyo hakuna pa kutafuta. Bado unaweza kucheza magnet au faili ya torrent unayoifungua mwenyewe.",
  "Ventic hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.": "Ventic haihifadhi maudhui, haiyaorodheshi, na huja bila vyanzo vyovyote vilivyowekwa. Ni programu ya BitTorrent yenye kicheza kilichoambatanishwa: hupata tu kile unachoielekeza, kutoka kwa seva ulizoziongeza mwenyewe.",
  "Ventic is MIT licensed. The components it is built on keep their own terms, listed above; on Windows the bundled mpv is GPL software and its licence and offer of source sit next to the application's executable.": "Ventic ina leseni ya MIT. Vipengele ilivyojengwa juu yake hubaki na masharti yake, yaliyoorodheshwa hapo juu; kwenye Windows, mpv iliyoambatanishwa ni programu ya GPL na leseni yake na ofa ya msimbo hukaa kando ya faili ya kutekeleza ya programu.",
  "Ventic is free and always will be. If it earned one, you can buy me a coffee.": "Ventic ni bure na itaendelea kuwa hivyo daima. Ikiwa imestahili, unaweza kuninunulia kahawa.",
  "Ventic is up to date.": "Ventic imesasishwa.",
  "Ventic keeps your library on this device. Carrying it to another screen is the backup file below.": "Ventic huhifadhi maktaba yako kwenye kifaa hiki. Kuipeleka kwenye skrini nyingine ni faili ya nakala rudufu iliyo hapa chini.",
  "Ventic searches nothing by itself. A source is a URL you add here, pointing at a server that answers with things to play. What a source offers, and whether you have the right to play it, is between you and whoever runs it.": "Ventic haitafuti chochote yenyewe. Chanzo ni URL unayoiongeza hapa, inayoelekeza kwenye seva inayojibu kwa vitu vya kucheza. Kile chanzo kinachotoa, na kama una haki ya kukicheza, ni kati yako na yeyote anayekiendesha.",
  "Ventic speaks the {protocol}. Any Stremio addon URL works here — paste the {link} link or the {manifest} address and it'll be trimmed to what's needed.": "Ventic huzungumza {protocol}. URL yoyote ya kiongezi cha Stremio hufanya kazi hapa — bandika kiungo cha {link} au anwani ya {manifest} nayo itapunguzwa hadi kinachohitajika.",
  "Ventic will send it the title you're looking for and play what it hands back. Only add servers you trust — this one is not run by, or checked by, this app.": "Ventic itatuma kichwa unachokitafuta na kucheza kile itakachorudisha. Ongeza tu seva unazoziamini — hii haiendeshwi wala haikaguliwi na programu hii.",
