  "Where downloads go": "Vipakuliwa vinapoenda",
  "Where films and episodes are written. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Mahali filamu na vipindi vinapoandikwa. Torrent zilizopakuliwa tayari hubaki zilipo.",
  "Where to keep downloads": "Mahali pa kuhifadhi vipakuliwa",
  "Which drive films and episodes are written to — a plugged-in stick usually holds far more than the box itself. Uninstalling the app still removes them. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Diski ambayo filamu na vipindi huandikwa — kijiti kilichochomekwa mara nyingi hubeba zaidi sana kuliko kisanduku chenyewe. Kuondoa programu bado huviondoa. Torrent zilizopakuliwa tayari hubaki zilipo.",
  "Worth turning on wherever the app feels heavy — a television or a set-top box most of all, where the graphics chip is a fraction of a laptop's.": "Inafaa kuwashwa mahali popote programu inapohisi nzito — kwenye televisheni au kisanduku cha juu ya televisheni zaidi ya yote, ambapo chipu ya grafiki ni sehemu ndogo ya ile ya kompyuta ndogo.",
